Bugfix: Accept null in User::setEMailAddress() and setDisplayName() without a deprecation

User::setEMailAddress() is documented to accept null to remove the address,
but passed it straight to trim(), which raises "Passing null to parameter #1
($string) of type string is deprecated" on PHP 8.1 and later. null is now
treated as an empty string, which is what trim() already returned. The same
applies to setDisplayName().

https://github.com/owncloud/core/pull/41897
